# Build output and Xcode derived data. `build/Build/Products/Release` is the
# locally delivered app; everything under build/ is regenerable.
build/
DerivedData/
*.xcuserstate
**/xcuserdata/

# Test and verification evidence. Disposable; clear it with scripts/clean.py.
artifacts/
*.xcresult
*.trace
*.log

# Disk images and checksums produced by scripts/package.py
WallpaperMachine-*.dmg
WallpaperMachine-*.dmg.sha256

# Local private wallpaper corpus and its notes; see docs/testing/wallpaper-corpus.md
wallpaper-corpus/
docs/testing/wallpaper-corpus.local.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Credentials
.env
.env.*

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Agent tooling: commit policy, never state. Shared agent rules live in tracked
# AGENTS.md (CLAUDE.md is its symlink) and docs/. These dirs hold machine-local
# sessions, caches, workspaces and personal rules; never `git add -f` them.
# Adding a new agent tool? Ignore its dir here in the same change.
#
# Exception recipe (list any exception in AGENTS.md). `!` cannot re-include a
# file whose parent dir is excluded, so switch `dir/` to `dir/*` and re-include
# each parent level, e.g. to share only .agents/skills/sources.json:
#   .agents/*
#   !.agents/skills/
#   .agents/skills/*
#   !.agents/skills/sources.json
.pi/
.omp/
.omo/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/wallpaper-issue
!.claude/skills/hotfix-release
.agents/*
!.agents/skills/
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/wallpaper-issue/
!.agents/skills/hotfix-release/
.conductor/
.commandcode/
CLAUDE.local.md

# Local working plans shared by the developer and agent sessions on this machine;
# never commit or push them.
.plans/

# Root npm files belong to local agent tooling; WebUI has no npm build.
/node_modules/
/package.json
/package-lock.json

# Rust workspace output
Renderer/target/
